flowchart TD
    START([inicio]) --> REQ[REQUESTED<br/>creator solicitou entrada]

    REQ -->|recusa| REJ[REJECTED]
    REQ -->|GATE 1: aceita| ACC[ACCEPTED<br/>valor definido no range<br/>RESERVA o valor]

    ACC -->|desiste| WD[WITHDRAWN<br/>libera reserva]
    ACC -->|participa| PART[PARTICIPATING<br/>produz conteudo]

    PART -->|prazo expira| EXP[EXPIRED<br/>libera reserva]
    PART -->|submete| SUB[SUBMITTED<br/>aguardando avaliacao]

    SUB -->|GATE 2: aprova| APP[APPROVED<br/>PAGA o creator]
    SUB -->|GATE 2: recusa| DEC[DECLINED<br/>NAO paga<br/>libera reserva]

    classDef pay fill:#bbf7d0,stroke:#15803d,color:#000;
    classDef nopay fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#000;
    classDef reserve fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#000;
    classDef gate fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#000;
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#92400e,color:#000;

    class ACC reserve;
    class SUB gate;
    class APP pay;
    class DEC,REJ,WD,EXP nopay;
    class REQ,PART,START neutral;
